{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"text":", at the release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose documentation you’re reading. In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"<version>\")"],"syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Register the wallet","anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Provide the keys and the storage","anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential copy is bound to — signs when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Credential Request’s proof when receiving or refreshing. By default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode each time: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true},{"text":" describes the trade-off.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". The app and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extension then share one store: a store of your own implements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/compareAndSwap(id:expected:record:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" atomically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across both processes, as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" does with a file","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lock.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Create the wallet","anchor":"Create-the-wallet","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind. Each trust role whose roots you set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs a revocation choice: checked against the CRLs your app fetches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), or declined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/noRevocationCheck","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"); see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, crls: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots,","            crls: crls,","            revocation: [.issuer, .status, .verifier])","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","text":"Ship the release build","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting started"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","type":"topic","title":"WalletProvider","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","title":"Handling errors","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helps without personal data.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store (the Secure Enclave). ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the standard one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a ","type":"text"},{"code":".platform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" WalletError.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore","type":"topic","title":"KeyStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"text":"A store in the app group ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its extensions listing the group in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.security.application-groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement share.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inAppGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Options","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","title":"Wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","title":"KeychainKeyStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform’s data protection. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"CredentialStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/revocation":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/revocation","abstract":[{"text":"The trust roles whose certificate chains must pass a CRL check","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against ","type":"text"},{"code":"crls","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A role listed fails closed for any CA it has no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current CRL from, until ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wallet.setCRLs(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" supplies one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Outside "},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", each role whose roots are set must be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listed here or in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":", or the wallet isn’t made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"invalidInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"revocation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationRole","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV14RevocationRoleO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/revocation","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"revocation"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier (","type":"text"},{"code":"-tags mobiletest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should refuse to run on it.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier",